        "original_id": "cae89cbb-0213-53f4-b965-8212b469b7ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Karaar, Galgale Nighale, Gori Gauri Mandavakhali\n- People: Manoj Kotian, Subodh Bhave, Urmila Kothare, Kranti Redkar, Suhasini Mule, Aarti More, Avdhoot Gupte, Shreya Ghoshal, Bela Shende, Sonu Kakkar, Jasraj Joshi, Neha Rajpal, Vaishali Samant, Anand Shinde\n- Topics: Marathi film, playback singing, music composition, lyrics\n\nFacts:\n- Karaar is a Marathi feature film directed by Manoj Kotian.\n- Karaar stars Subodh Bhave, Urmila Kothare, Kranti Redkar, Suhasini Mule, and Aarti More.\n- Songs from Karaar are sung by Avdhoot Gupte, Shreya Ghoshal, Bela Shende, Sonu Kakkar, Jasraj Joshi, Neha Rajpal, and Vaishali Samant.\n- Vaishali Samant is an Indian music composer, lyricist, and playback singer known for her work in the Marathi film and music industry.\n- Gori Gauri Mandavakhali is a superhit song from the film Galgale Nighale.\n- Vaishali Samant and Anand Shinde sang Gori Gauri Mandavakhali.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
